              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 3.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These two kings were defeated by Moses and the people of Israel. Moses, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s servant, gave their land to the tribes of Reuben and Gad and to half the tribe of Manasseh, to be their possession.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
